Like who do you send notices to?

00:17:12.720 --> 00:17:14.330
I wanted to answer this question,

00:17:14.330 --> 00:17:17.930
because that has been such a huge saga.

00:17:17.930 --> 00:17:19.870
There are procedures
for this kind of thing.

00:17:19.870 --> 00:17:22.470
But given that we live not only in a world

00:17:22.470 --> 00:17:24.340
where it's hard to sue the government

00:17:24.340 --> 00:17:26.440
and to be able to serve process.

00:17:26.440 --> 00:17:29.030
So we haven't served subpoenas
so much as FOIA requests

00:17:29.030 --> 00:17:31.610
and then serving process of the complaint

00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:32.940
on these government agencies.

00:17:32.940 --> 00:17:34.620
But also we're dealing with COVID,

00:17:34.620 --> 00:17:36.760
and everyone's working from home.

00:17:36.760 --> 00:17:39.600
The shenanigans that the
various government agencies

00:17:39.600 --> 00:17:42.540
have been pulling with respect
to not accepting service

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:43.820
of things that they absolutely

00:17:43.820 --> 00:17:45.390
should be accepting service on.

00:17:45.390 --> 00:17:46.780
Changing their addresses,

00:17:46.780 --> 00:17:50.080
saying that we need to send
notices to different people.

00:17:50.080 --> 00:17:51.690
Not accepting the mail,

00:17:51.690 --> 00:17:54.180
like the US Post Office is
having a hard time getting

00:17:54.180 --> 00:17:56.020
a hold of these various agencies.

00:17:56.020 --> 00:17:58.890
It's been a mess, and it's
been sort of hilarious

00:17:58.890 --> 00:18:00.840
and maybe this is just the sort of thing

00:18:00.840 --> 00:18:03.410
that lawyers who are totally
wonks about this thing,

00:18:03.410 --> 00:18:04.600
find interesting.

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:05.940
But it's been a crapshoot,

00:18:05.940 --> 00:18:07.350
and it's been a whole thing.

00:18:07.350 --> 00:18:08.942
I can't wait to tell you
about it at some point.

00:18:08.942 --> 00:18:09.775
(laughing)

00:18:09.775 --> 00:18:10.950
Alright, and then finally,

00:18:10.950 --> 00:18:13.640
user Paulo Emmanuel Tavares asks,

00:18:13.640 --> 00:18:15.720
