00:18:15.720 --> 00:18:17.460
do you think that the courts
might delay the decision

00:18:17.460 --> 00:18:19.130
until after the election?

00:18:19.130 --> 00:18:21.220
So I sort of dispute the fact

00:18:21.220 --> 00:18:23.530
that this is a politically charged case.

00:18:23.530 --> 00:18:25.330
This is about governmental transparency.

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:27.360
I think everyone on
both sides of the aisle

00:18:27.360 --> 00:18:29.800
thinks that's John Bolton's information

00:18:29.800 --> 00:18:31.510
is probably pretty important.

00:18:31.510 --> 00:18:33.950
And if the government did everything right

00:18:33.950 --> 00:18:36.870
and wasn't playing games
with classified information,

00:18:36.870 --> 00:18:38.710
then that's important to know.

00:18:38.710 --> 00:18:40.730
And we can take faith

00:18:40.730 --> 00:18:43.190
in the government conducting
prepublication review.

00:18:43.190 --> 00:18:44.880
If it turns out that's not the case

00:18:44.880 --> 00:18:47.090
that perhaps we should
support John Bolton,

00:18:47.090 --> 00:18:50.260
and we should be really, really mad

00:18:50.260 --> 00:18:53.220
that the government
censored his information

00:18:53.220 --> 00:18:55.010
if it was for political reasons.

00:18:55.010 --> 00:18:57.190
So it doesn't seem like
governmental transparency

00:18:57.190 --> 00:18:58.850
should be a political issue.

00:18:58.850 --> 00:19:02.260
In terms of how the judiciary
is going to react to this.

00:19:02.260 --> 00:19:04.470
I don't think they're going
to care one way or the other.

00:19:04.470 --> 00:19:07.400
Federal judges are very, very independent.

00:19:07.400 --> 00:19:09.980
Federal judges, especially
at the district court level

00:19:09.980 --> 00:19:11.630
are really just umpires.

00:19:11.630 --> 00:19:14.040
They apply the law to the facts,

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:16.360
and the law is pretty cut and dry.

00:19:16.360 --> 00:19:18.570
So I would not be particularly concerned

00:19:18.570 --> 00:19:22.970
about any particular federal
judge playing political games

00:19:22.970 --> 00:19:24.670
in this particular case.

